<title>USA: Tracor finalized tender offer price.</title>
<headline>Tracor finalized tender offer price.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tracor Inc on Monday said it would pay 106.5 percent for each of its 10.875 percent senior subordinated notes due 2001.</p>
<p>The offer to purchase and solicitation of consents with respect to these notes were announced by Tracor on February 14.</p>
<p>Tracor is a defense electronics company that provides electronic and information technology products, systems, and services.</p>
